@host = http://localhost:3000

### Verificar saúde
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Consultar métricas
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard

### Buscar opções de clientes
GET {{host}}/api/customers/options

### Buscar faturas
GET {{host}}/api/invoices

### Buscar fatura por identificador
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/1

### Buscar fatura por identificador inválido
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/abc

### Buscar fatura por identificador inexistente
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/999999

### Criar fatura
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "pending",
    "issueDate": "2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}

### Atualizar fatura
PUT {{host}}/api/invoices/181
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "paid",
    "issueDate": "2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-22"
}

### Deletar fatura
DELETE {{host}}/api/invoices/181

### Validação: rejeitar criação com campos inválidos (HTTP 400, sem gravar)
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 0,
  "amount": 0,
  "status": "overdue",
  "issueDate": "2026-11-05",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-01"
}

### Validação: rejeitar edição com vencimento anterior à emissão (HTTP 400)
PUT {{host}}/api/invoices/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "amount": 125000,
  "status": "pending",
  "issueDate": "2026-11-05",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-01"
}
